or use in high-density power converter circuits. They offer high current ratings, making them ideal for high switching frequencies with low AC losses. These high-performance molded power inductors offer an inductance range of 5.6µH to 22µH and no thermal aging. The XAL50xx series utilizes a composite construction to minimize audible buzzing. They meet AEC-Q200 Grade 1 standards (-40°C to +125°C) with a 165°C max part temperature. A sample kit is available. \n\n## Availability\n\nStock:\n\n    \n\n[Button: Restricted Availability]\n\n    \n\n## Packaging Choice\n\nSome options may not be available based on your order quantity.\n\nCut Tape\n\nProduct is cut from a full reel tape into customized quantities.\n\nMouseReel™ (Add $7.00 reeling fee)\n\nA product reel is cut according to customer-specified quantities. All MouseReel orders are non-cancellable and non-returnable.\n\nFull Reels\n\nThe ordered quantity must match the manufacturer's full reel quantity. To purchase full reel, order in multiples of 250.\n\nReel and Cut Tape\n\nOrder product as combination of a full reel and cut tape.\n\nReel and MouseReel™ (Add $7.00 reeling fee)\n\nOrder product as a combination of a full reel and a MouseReel™.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nXAL5050-682MEC Coilcraft | Mouser Europe (https://eu.mouser.com/en/ProductDetail/Coilcraft/XAL5050-682MEC?qs=zCSbvcPd3pYONeFBFYs95w%3D%3D)\nciteturn2search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; # XAL5050-682MEC\n\n# XAL5050-682MEC\n\nImage: Coilcraft\n\nImage: Coilcraft XAL5050-682MEC Enlarged Image\n\nImages are for reference only\nSee Product Specifications\n\nShare This\n\nThe link could not be generated at this time. Please try again.\n\nMouser No:\n\n994-XAL5050-682MEC [Input]\n\nMfr. No:\n\nXAL5050-682MEC [Input]\n\n## \n\nMfr.:\n\nCoilcraft\n\n[Input]\n\nCustomer No:\n\n[Input: Customer No]\n\n[Input] [Input]\n\n## \n\nDescription:\n\nPower Inductors - SMD 6.8uH Shld 20% 6.4A 29.45mOhms